(7462465, 1183827, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but it looks very oversharpened, and there''s a huge halo around the flying bird''s wings... 5 as is -- would be up to a 7 without the issues.</td>', 'I like the shot, but it looks very oversharpened, and there''s a huge halo around the flying bird''s wings... 5 as is -- would be up to a 7 without the issues.', '2016-07-01 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7462466, 1183508, 103142, '<td valign="top">This could have been so much better, imo, with different processing. The underexposed and the vignette seems rather heavy handed and doesn''t add to the overall feeling of the photo, imo. Brightening it, bringing out the eye and the wonderful details that you''ve captured would have worked better, I think...</td>', 'This could have been so much better, imo, with different processing. The underexposed and the vignette seems rather heavy handed and doesn''t add to the overall feeling of the photo, imo. Brightening it, bringing out the eye and the wonderful details that you''ve captured would have worked better, I think...', '2016-07-01 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
