(7463600, 1183767, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dennisheckman:</b></div><hr/><i> Holy Smokes! I thought you didn''t have time for photography! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Would it make you feel better or worse if I told you that both this and the hummingbird were taken from within 3 feet of each other while either standing or sitting on my deck?  With this one I was sitting with a cigar and, IIRC, a bourbon. :)<br/> <br/>Sometimes you go to nature, some times it comes to you.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dennisheckman: Holy Smokes! I thought you didn''t have time for photography!   Would it make you feel better or worse if I told you that both this and the hummingbird were taken from within 3 feet of each other while either standing or sitting on my deck?  With this one I was sitting with a cigar and, IIRC, a bourbon. :) Sometimes you go to nature, some times it comes to you.', '2016-07-08 16:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
